    SHIFT POSITION    INDICATOR
               GUID-ABB1DD25-E786-4B75-9A1A-54DB7DEB4D8A
    The shift position indicator indicates the shift
    lever position when the power switch is in the
    ON or READY to drive position. (See “20. Shift
    position indicator” (P.2-27) and “Electric shift
    control system” (P.5-9).)

             CAUTION:
    Do not hold the shift lever in any position
    other than the center position. Continued
    driving with the shift lever out of position
    could lead to damage to the vehicle. Addi-
    tionally, if the shift lever is placed out of
    position, the position indicator blinks.



