    HAZARD INDICATOR AND OUTSIDE CHIME OPERATION
             HP15A1-120227-4D14C69A-7CFE-4599-A334-6FBCB4DBDF61
    When you lock or unlock the doors with the request switch or the remote keyless entry function,
    the hazard indicator will flash and the outside chime will sound as a confirmation.
    The following descriptions show how the hazard indicator and outside chime will activate when
    locking or unlocking the doors.
    Except for Mexico:

                  Operation                                DOOR LOCK                DOOR UNLOCK
       Intelligent Key system (using            HAZARD - once               HAZARD - twice
               request switch)                  OUTSIDE CHIME - once        OUTSIDE CHIME - twice
       Remote keyless entry system              HAZARD - once               HAZARD - twice
        (using       or     button)             OUTSIDE CHIME - once        OUTSIDE CHIME - twice
    For Mexico:

                  Operation                                DOOR LOCK                DOOR UNLOCK
       Intelligent Key system (using            HAZARD - twice              HAZARD - once
               request switch)                  OUTSIDE CHIME - twice       OUTSIDE CHIME - once
       Remote keyless entry system              HAZARD - twice              HAZARD - once
        (using       or     button)             HORN - once                 HORN - none




