                                                    SIC2045

    The security indicator light is located on the
    meter panel. It indicates the status of NATS.
    The light operates whenever the power switch
    is in the “OFF” position. The security indicator
    light indicates that the security systems on the
    vehicle are operational.
    If NATS is malfunctioning, this light will remain
    on while the power switch is in the “ON”
    position.
    If the light remains on and/or the e-POWER
    system does not start, contact a NISSAN
    dealer for NATS service as soon as possible.
    Be sure to bring all NATS keys that you have
    when visiting a NISSAN dealer for service.




