                                                                                                                    ing dirt or snow from the front of the camera.
                                                                                                                    The Intelligent Around View Monitor system is
                                                                                                                    designed as an aid to the driver in situations
                                                                                                                    such as slot parking or parallel parking.
                                                                                                                    The monitor displays various views of the
                                                                                                                    position of the vehicle in a split screen format.
                                                                                                                    Not all views are available at all times.
                                                                                                                    Available views:
                                                                                                                    . Front view
                                                                                                                        An approximately 150–degree view of the
                                                                                                                        front of the vehicle.
                                                                                                                    . Rear view
                                                                                                                        An approximately 150–degree view of the
                                                                                                                        rear of the vehicle.
                                                                                                                    . Bird’s-eye view
                                                                                                                        The surrounding views of the vehicle from
                                                                                                                        above.
                                                                                                                    . Front-side view
                                                                                                                        The view around and ahead of the front
                                                                                                                        passenger’s side wheel.
